   'DailyMed/FDA (NIH/NLM) — approved Bisoprolol label: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=4f20df45-3f9c-4a91-b394-e93a08111ec3'),
  ('rosuvastatina',
   'A rosuvastatina é uma estatina de alta potência que inibe seletivamente a HMG-CoA redutase, reduzindo a síntese hepática de colesterol e elevando os recetores LDL.',
   'Rosuvastatin is a high-intensity statin that selectively inhibits HMG-CoA reductase, reducing hepatic cholesterol synthesis and upregulating LDL receptors.',
   'Hipercolesterolemia primária\nHiperlipidemia mista\nPrevenção cardiovascular primária e secundária\nAterosclerose progressiva',
   'Primary hypercholesterolaemia\nMixed dyslipidaemia\nPrimary and secondary cardiovascular prevention\nProgressive atherosclerosis',
